        "thought_text": "The current approach of checking all possible combinations of 3 participants for each team is inefficient and leads to incorrect results. Instead, we should consider the total sum of all scores and check if it's divisible by 2. If it is, we can then check if it's possible to form two teams with equal scores by using dynamic programming or a similar approach. This method would be more efficient and avoid the error in the original code.",
